# The logo; the key 5 from the logo (no music); a click on a ring, then 5
# again, which inits the level under the fade; the key 9, which inits the
# level 08 and shows a level 09 never initialized (as the C: zeros), and a
# click there; the keys 1 and 0.
FRAMES=1200
SEED=1
INPUT=300:dn:5,301:up:5,420:mv:450:360,420:md:0,421:mu:0,450:dn:5,451:up:5,600:dn:9,601:up:9,750:mv:640:360,750:md:0,751:mu:0,800:dn:1,801:up:1,950:dn:0,951:up:0
SHOTS="1 85 140 152 300 330 360 400 421 451 480 520 600 650 700 751 800 900 1000 1100 1200"
